<title>ITALY: INA to by BNL Vita from Bnl.</title>
<headline>INA to by BNL Vita from Bnl.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's INA insurers said on Monday they would by BNL Vita from Banca Nazionale del Lavoro and would also cede control of INA Banca to BNL.</p>
<p>The moves were part of a joint effort to bid for a 60 percent stake in ailing Banco di Napoli</p>
